    <div class="tc-about__inner">
        <div class="tc-section-label">About Us</div>
        <h2 class="tc-about__title">What Makes TotalCare Different?</h2>
        <p class="tc-about__desc">
            TotalCare Engineering Services (Pvt) Ltd is a Sri Lanka based multidisciplinary engineering services company delivering reliable technical repair and maintenance solutions across the automotive, welding, industrial, HVAC, and roofing sectors. We specialize in repair, maintenance, fabrication, and installation services, providing practical, efficient, and cost-effective engineering support to our clients.
            Our team is made up of skilled technicians and experienced engineers with strong hands-on industry expertise. We are committed to high-quality workmanship, strict safety standards, and timely project execution. From automotive repairs and mechanical fabrication to HVAC systems, electrical wiring, Painting, hydraulic services, and roofing construction work, we provide complete end-to-end solutions under one roof.
            At TotalCare Engineering Services, we prioritize long-term reliability, customer satisfaction, and continuous improvement. Whether handling a minor repair or managing a large-scale engineering project, we approach every assignment with precision, accountability, and professionalism.
        </p>
